{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-07-14 16:15:00', 'title': 'SWEP LAUNCHES TWO NEW HIGH-EFFICIENCY PRODUCTS', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , JULY 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SWEP, PART OF DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV)\xa0AND A WORLD-LEADING SUPPLIER OF BRAZED PLATE HEAT EXCHANGERS (BPHES), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THE B8DW DOUBLE-WALL COMPACT HEAT EXCHANGER AND THE FI22AS HIGH-EFFICIENCY CONDENSER AND EVAPORATOR.'}